# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=libx11
pkgver=1.8.12
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="The core X11 client library"
arch=(x86_64)
url="https://www.x.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(libxcb)
source=("https://www.x.org/releases/individual/lib/libX11-$pkgver.tar.xz")
sha256sums=('fa026f9bb0124f4d6c808f9aef4057aad65e7b35d8ff43951cef0abe06bb9a9a')

build() {
    cd libX11-$pkgver
    ./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc --localstatedir=/var --disable-static \
        --disable-specs
    make
}

package() {
    cd libX11-$pkgver
    make DESTDIR="$pkgdir" install
}
